  "notes": [
    "**Desear** is a regular **-AR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: **deseado** (regular)",
    "More formal than **querer** (to want)",
    "Common usage:",
    "*Te deseo buena suerte* (I wish you good luck)",
    "*Deseo viajar* (I wish to travel)",
    "*¿Qué desea?* (What would you like? - formal, like in a store)",
    "Related noun: **el deseo** (wish, desire)",
    "Common expressions: *desear lo mejor* (to wish the best), *dejar mucho que desear* (to leave much to be desired)"
